5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the diggers will hit soft ground and the dates will slip. Who else is checking the site conditions?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good question, Kenji. I’m less worried about the diggers and more about how the ground behaves once the ribbon is cut. Who else is looking at the drainage?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m curious about who will actually look after the park every week. The rota seems very short lately.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to see what our previous projects actually look like now, not just the drawings. Who is checking the condition of the earlier works?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m concerned about the long-term upkeep costs. Who else is looking at the annual maintenance figures?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, that makes sense. I’ll check the firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes to see if we can keep the park open.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the drainage callouts and the weekday crossing counts. I need to know if the ground and the people actually agree with the plan.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will look into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to see who is really there to help.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’ll check the condition of the earlier programme works and the eastern avenue planting record. I need to see what actually survived the last decade.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund. I need to know the true long-term cost.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Minato, that’s a great point! I hope the volunteers are ready for the extra work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, the casual pool is a start, but I suspect the real strain will show up in the wet months.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, I hope the casual pool is enough. I am a bit worried they might get tired.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The wet months are when shortcuts become visible. I’ll see what the earlier works tell us.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I agree. The ledger will show if the savings are real or just deferred. I’ll check the fund terms too.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Minako, I hope the earlier works survived! I’m still nervous about the clay, but I’ll see what the firms say.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the clay is a real risk, but I suspect the drainage will be the bigger headache. Let’s see what the data says.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Kenji, I hope the ground is okay. I am just trying to understand who will be there every day to help.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Kenji, the clay is a risk, but the drainage will be the bigger headache. Let’s see what the data says.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
